      "summary_en": "Anivia brings her wings together and summons a sphere of ice that flies towards her opponents, chilling and damaging anyone in its path. When the sphere explodes it does moderate damage in a radius, stunning anyone in the area.",
      "summary_zh": "艾尼维亚挥动翅膀聚集空气，制造一枚冰晶向目标区域施放，冰冻并伤害路径上的所有敌人。当冰晶爆裂时，它会晕眩并伤害一定范围内的所有敌人。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1306450:4026612"
      ]
